infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Embedding http.ResponseWriter: forwarded vs erased
  desc Embedding hands you the 3 interface methods and silently drops the 3 optional capabilities
  compares
    - label Forwarded by embedding
      children
        - label Header()
          desc Read and set response headers
        - label Write([]byte)
          desc Write the response body bytes
        - label WriteHeader(int)
          desc Send the status line once
    - label Silently erased
      children
        - label http.Flusher
          desc Flush() lost — SSE and streaming stall
        - label http.Hijacker
          desc Hijack() lost — websocket upgrade fails
        - label io.ReaderFrom
          desc ReadFrom() lost — sendfile fast path gone
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
